    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 16</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LX} Se ðe ðeof ofslihð, se mot gecyðan mid aðe þæt he hine synnigne ofsloge; nalles ða gegildan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who kills a thief may declare with an oath that he killed him because he was [found] guilty [in the act]; this does not apply to his associates.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">He who kills a thief shall be allowed to declare on oath that the man he slew was guilty. The associates of the slain man shall not be allowed to proceed to an oath.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe ðeof ofslihð, se mot gecyþan mid his aðe, þæt he hine synnigne ofsloge, nallæs ða gegildan.</ab>
      </div>
